Dear Irene,

I meant amplitude modulations but it is true that the overall amplitude is not kept.

To do so, at least when saving the filtered wave:

a <- readWave () # f = 44100Hz

ffa <-ffilter(a, from=0, to=22050, bandpass=TRUE, output=“Wave”)

savewav(ffa, filename="ffa_filtered.wav", rescale=range(a@left))

I will try to change this directly in ffilter() for the next version of seewave.

HTH

Jerome
